@base = http://127.0.0.1:18081
@token = replace-with-demo-login-token

### 演示登录
POST {{base}}/demo/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"13800000001"}

### 商户与券
GET {{base}}/voucher/list/1

### 抢券；返回的订单号要继续查结果
POST {{base}}/voucher-order/seckill/101
authorization: {{token}}
X-Request-Id: demo-request-001

### 查看自己的订单
GET {{base}}/voucher-order/my
authorization: {{token}}
